WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.342
Sets also make group comparison very convenient.

00:00:03.342 --> 00:00:07.392
Union gives every customer who appeared in either season.

00:00:07.392 --> 00:00:13.087
Intersection gives customers in both seasons, which here are C103 and C104.

00:00:13.087 --> 00:00:22.012
Spring minus summer gives customers who appeared only in spring, while summer minus spring gives those who appeared only

00:00:22.012 --> 00:00:23.069
in summer.

00:00:23.738 --> 00:00:30.896
These operations are useful for comparing cohorts, membership lists, categories, and other groups.
